{"1635880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "All Eyes Above", "steam_appid": 1635880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Move. Hide. Fight.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In All Eyes Above, you and your crew are the last line of defence between civilisation and complete annihilation. An all-powerful satellite network has destroyed life as we know it and will not stop until it eradicates anything that moves. While the inevitable destruction continues, you battle a ruthless faction that seeks total control of the remaining resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/c804e519987ed66f8ef0646770a00fd0.poster.avif?t=1777808946\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/c804e519987ed66f8ef0646770a00fd0.webm?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/c804e519987ed66f8ef0646770a00fd0.mp4?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a Rider</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Archangel satellite system destroys life on Earth, some cities remain alive and in hiding. Heaven17 is your oasis in the wasteland, but it relies on a small group of elite soldiers to keep it running. With resources at a critical level, you and your friends are conscripted to save the day. As a rider you must fight in a high-velocity resource war where each mission could be your last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/dd03cf0989183c450ae2f9eb34697ec1.poster.avif?t=1777808946\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/dd03cf0989183c450ae2f9eb34697ec1.webm?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/dd03cf0989183c450ae2f9eb34697ec1.mp4?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Battlefield of Moving Vehicles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Archangel rewrites the rules of war. In order to avoid a weapon that is constantly searching for them, riders must protect the one thing that keeps them hidden while fighting in moving battlefields. With the Oppressors striving for control, your crew will have to defend your ship and destroy your adversaries. Use grapples, harpoons, high-tech weapons and even exploit the Archangel network itself to strike back. But, don’t forget about what’s happening on your own ship; repair and control it to stay in the fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/4a07566934a2026799c011dc11436f62.poster.avif?t=1777808946\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/4a07566934a2026799c011dc11436f62.webm?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/4a07566934a2026799c011dc11436f62.mp4?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Are You a Hero of Heaven17</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 10 mission campaign, your crew will grapple around ships, hack aboard enemy transports, and capture Angelite fuel while fending off hordes of Oppressors and avoiding detection. Heaven17 has kept your crew alive throughout everything and now it’s up to you to protect them! Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/adfcaf32b47efe7838ce6601c76d999f.poster.avif?t=1777808946\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/adfcaf32b47efe7838ce6601c76d999f.webm?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/adfcaf32b47efe7838ce6601c76d999f.mp4?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All eyes above!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Move. Hide. Fight.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In All Eyes Above, you and your crew are the last line of defence between civilisation and complete annihilation. An all-powerful satellite network has destroyed life as we know it and will not stop until it eradicates anything that moves. While the inevitable destruction continues, you battle a ruthless faction that seeks total control of the remaining resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/c804e519987ed66f8ef0646770a00fd0.poster.avif?t=1777808946\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/c804e519987ed66f8ef0646770a00fd0.webm?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/c804e519987ed66f8ef0646770a00fd0.mp4?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a Rider</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Archangel satellite system destroys life on Earth, some cities remain alive and in hiding. Heaven17 is your oasis in the wasteland, but it relies on a small group of elite soldiers to keep it running. With resources at a critical level, you and your friends are conscripted to save the day. As a rider you must fight in a high-velocity resource war where each mission could be your last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/dd03cf0989183c450ae2f9eb34697ec1.poster.avif?t=1777808946\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/dd03cf0989183c450ae2f9eb34697ec1.webm?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/dd03cf0989183c450ae2f9eb34697ec1.mp4?t=1777808946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Battlefield of Moving Vehicles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Archangel rewrites the rules of war. In order to avoid a weapon that is constantly searching for them, riders must protect the one thing that keeps them hidden while fighting in moving battlefields. With the Oppressors striving for control, your crew will have to defend your ship and destroy your adversaries. Use grapples, harpoons, high-tech weapons and even exploit the Archangel network itself to strike back. But, don’t forget about what’s happening on your own ship; repair and control it to stay in the fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635880/extras/4a07566934a2026799c011dc11436f62.poster.avif?t=1777808946\" width=780 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item